{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "framework": "playwright",
  "testId": "testim-migrated/tests/webstore/pdp/verify-bundle-product-details-on-pdp.spec.ts > Webstore - PDP > verify bundle product details on pdp",
  "scenario": {
    "summary": "Guest searches the webstore for a bundle product by SKU, opens its PDP and validates the header details, highlights, retail and sales price, three tiered offers, personalisation field, checkbox add-on group and options, stock status, the Included Products table (child SKU, quantity, warehouse, inventory), the info tabs and the Frequently Bought / You May Also Like cards. Read-only; nothing is added to the cart.",
    "steps": [
      "Open the webstore as a guest (empty storageState).",
      "Search for the bundle SKU, assert 'Showing 1 of 1 Results' and open the result for that SKU.",
      "Assert image, breadcrumb Home/<category>/<name>, wishlist heart, product name, SKU, brand and short description.",
      "Assert the Free Shipping, WaterSense and Bio highlights, See More, retail price, sales price and star rating.",
      "Assert the three tiered special offers (buy quantity, price per item, discount percentage).",
      "Assert the personalisation label and input, the 'Add-on options' heading, the checkbox add-on group label and each add-on option, and the stock status.",
      "Assert the 'Included Products' table: per child product its SKU, quantity in bundle, warehouse name, inventory text and warehouse address.",
      "Assert Print, See More and Email a Friend buttons; assert the Details, Specifications and Shipping Info tab panels and open Reviews.",
      "Assert the Frequently Bought and You May Also Like sections and their cards (name, SKU, Read Reviews, Add to Cart)."
    ],
    "entitiesTouched": [
      "product",
      "brand",
      "category",
      "warehouse",
      "store"
    ],
    "stateChanges": [],
    "assertions": [
      "Search for the bundle SKU shows exactly one result ('Showing 1 of 1 Results').",
      "Breadcrumb, heading, SKU:<sku>, Brand:<brand> and short description match the bundle.",
      "Retail price and sales price equal the recorded amounts.",
      "Three tiered offers show 'Buy N or more', '$<price>/item' and 'Save <discount>%'.",
      "Personalisation label equals the attribute code; checkbox add-on group label and each add-on option label (with its price) are shown; stock status contains 'In Stock'.",
      "Included Products table lists each child SKU with quantity, warehouse name, inventory text and warehouse address.",
      "Details, Specifications and Shipping Info panels contain the recorded texts.",
      "Frequently Bought and You May Also Like cards show the recorded product names and SKUs with Read Reviews and Add to Cart."
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Title 'verify bundle product details on pdp' and the eight step labels match the flow; guest storageState; no linked AIO cases.",
      "All data comes from loadData(BundleDataSchema, rawData, ...) (spec line 52).",
      "Profile: SKU z-1234579 FOUND as BundleProduct, active, PRODUCTION, brand Dewalt, inventory 28362, storefrontProductIndex 1, requiredAddOnCount 0. The name matched 2 rows (z-1234579, z-345678).",
      "Profile: child SKUs z-1234582, z-1234607, z-1234580 and the related products are FOUND active SimpleProducts; youMayAlsoLike.1 (z-1234603) shows negative inventory (-619687597).",
      "Params: minAddOns 1 + addOnDisplayType CheckBox because the PDP must show one checkbox add-on group (data.addOnOptionType Checkbox, three options); minPersonalizableAttributes 1 + personalizationAttribute AdditionalInformation because the PDP must show that personalisation field (data.personalisationLabel, page object personalisationInput is #AdditionalInformation). The test selects nothing.",
      "Gap: PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IN_STOCK returns only sku, name, productId, price, addOnProductId, addOnName. The asserted category, brand, short description, retail/sales price, tier offers, add-on option labels, child-product table, tab texts and related products have no output; a migrated spec cannot get them from this key (a bundle PDP-details key like PRODUCT_CONFIGURABLE_PDP_DETAILS would be needed).",
      "Data in code: page object hardcodes the personalisation input #AdditionalInformation (= data.personalisationLabel), the add-on group test id lblAddOnGroupCheckbox (group name Checkbox) and the highlight selectors imgFreeShipping / imgWatersenseEpaCertified / imgBioCertified (product highlights, not in the JSON).",
      "migrate: data only through loadData, but expected values depend on the recorded bundle (retail/sales prices, tier prices and discounts, add-on option labels with prices, child-product list, descriptions, related products), and #AdditionalInformation is also in code.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: Header and tabs -> product: productSKU sku, productName name, productCategory categoryPath, productBrand brandName, productShortDescription shortDescription, productRetailPrice retailPrice, productSalesPrice salesPrice, personalisationLabel personalizationCode, addOnOptionType addOnGroupName (group label, test id lblAddOnGroup<name>), inventory inStockMessage, productDetails details, productShippingInfo shippingInfo (HTML in the DB: compare text). Supersedes the Gap line on PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IN_STOCK outputs.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: Tier offers specialOffer.buyQty1..3 / offerPrice1..3 -> product.tier1..3Qty / tier1..3Price (tiers by quantity).",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: Not produced: specialOffer.offerDiscount1..3 (percent saved) stay role data without output: they are derived from the price and the tier price, so the spec should compute them (round((price - tierNPrice) / price * 100)).",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: addOnOptions.0..2 ('<name>(+$<price>)') -> product.addOnName / addOn2Name / addOn3Name with addOnPrice / addOn2Price / addOn3Price for the price part (add-ons in display order).",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: bundleProductDetails.0..2 -> product.child1..3*: productName childNName, productSKU childNSku, productQty childNBundleQty, productWarehouseName childNInventory (first entry of 'warehouse=qty|...'), productInventory inStockMessage (the store's in-stock text). Children in display order.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: Not produced: bundleProductDetails.N.productWarehouseAddress (masked warehouse address) stays role data without output; no key returns warehouse addresses.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: productSpecifications.0..3 -> product.specifications (one HTML value; the four list items are its lines).",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: New needs frequentlyBought / youMayAlsoLike -> PRODUCT_LINKED_PRODUCTS {product @product.productId, linkType FrequentlyBought | YouMayAlsoLike, store, minLinked 2 | 3 (the cards the test walks through)}: the related products now come from the resolved product's own links (first three in PDP display order), so they stay consistent when the resolver falls back from the recorded product. Supersedes the GAP / missing-key lines on related products.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: frequentlyBoughtProducts.0..1 / youMayAlsoLike.0..2 name, SKU, retail and sales price -> frequentlyBought / youMayAlsoLike linkedNName, linkedNSku, linkedNRetailPrice, linkedNSalesPrice (guest prices on the store)."
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "needsReview": true
  },
  "requires": [
    {
      "key": "PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IN_STOCK",
      "alias": "product",
      "params": {
        "store": "MaxwellsHardware",
        "quantityUsed": 1,
        "minAddOns": 1,
        "addOnDisplayType": "CheckBox",
        "minPersonalizableAttributes": 1,
        "personalizationAttribute": "AdditionalInformation"
      },
      "preferred": {
        "source": 0,
        "required": false
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "PRODUCT_LINKED_PRODUCTS",
      "alias": "frequentlyBought",
      "params": {
        "product": "@product.productId",
        "linkType": "FrequentlyBought",
        "store": "MaxwellsHardware",
        "minLinked": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "PRODUCT_LINKED_PRODUCTS",
      "alias": "youMayAlsoLike",
      "params": {
        "product": "@product.productId",
        "linkType": "YouMayAlsoLike",
        "store": "MaxwellsHardware",
        "minLinked": 3
      }
    }
  ],
